From ed745f43be328a880b55979510b3adfab0c5d12d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Unleashed <codex-unleashed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 01:56:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Expand patch diff previews in the fullscreen transcript when
 configured

Tracks https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/47390.

The rich fullscreen transcript collapses each patch to a summary that the
reader must expand by hand. With codex_unleashed.expanded_diff_previews set
and the unleashed_expanded_diff_previews feature enabled, patch cells show
their full diff instead. The setting defaults to false and the feature to
enabled, so both must allow it. Failed-apply diagnostics keep their
existing disclosure, and detailed and raw modes are unchanged.
